  "prefLabel": "Lab 805.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2007-11-14",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 805.01 Purpose. A requirement for special authorization for a sub-minimum wage rate or no rate for students or adults with disabilities working for practical experience was created. These rules are intended to carry out the intent of RSA 279:22-aa by establishing a procedure for applicants and for approval by the commissioner.\n\nSource. #6996, eff 5-7-99, EXPIRED: 5-7-07\n\nNew. #8879, INTERIM, eff 5-18-07, EXPIRES: 11-14-07; ss by #9024, eff 11-9-07; ss by #11070, eff 4-11-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab800.html"
